WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.460
Call if you have a fever above 101.5

2
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.580
degrees Fahrenheit.

3
00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:09.580
Call if the skin behind your ear is swollen or feels

4
00:00:09.628 --> 00:00:11.500
like fluid is building up under it.

5
00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:13.500
Call if you have a headache,

6
00:00:13.593 --> 00:00:16.980
light sensitivity, or excessive lethargy.

7
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.900
Call if you have a wound-care question or another

8
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.700
medical concern about you or your child.
